randLogo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/ISI-Logo-White.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":241,"height":34}},"brandVisual":{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/ISI-Image.png 1353w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/ISI-Image-500x397.png 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/ISI-Image-768x610.png 768w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/ISI-Image.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1353,"height":1074}},"backgroundImage":{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-1400x762.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-2000x1089.jpg 2000w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-500x272.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-768x418.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-1536x836.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light-2048x1115.jpg 2048w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/results-light.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":2244,"height":1222}}}]}]]}],["$","$L24",null,{"data":{"heading":"Our web design and development process.","subheading":"Every project is different, but the thinking stays joined up. We move from discovery and digital strategy through UX, creative design and development without losing the thread (or the big idea) along the way.","enable":true,"blocks":[{"heading":" Discovery","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow3.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"Before opening Figma, we get properly under the skin of the business. We speak to stakeholders, review your current site, study the industry and dig into how your audience behaves. This gives us a clear view of what the website needs to communicate, where the existing experience is falling short and where there’s room to do something more interesting.","duration":"1 week","weekNumber":1,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Stakeholder questionnaires & interviews"},{"item":"Current website audit"},{"item":"Analytics review"},{"item":"Competitor review"},{"item":"Audience & category research"},{"item":"Kick-off meeting"}]},{"heading":"Digital strategy","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"This is where business goals become a plan for the website. We define what the experience needs to achieve, how content should work and which journeys matter most. Brand, audience, search visibility and conversion all shape the direction before we begin designing screens.","duration":"1 week","weekNumber":2,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Digital objectives"},{"item":"Content strategy"},{"item":"SEO considerations"},{"item":"Conversion opportunities"},{"item":"Feature requirements"},{"item":"Technical recommendations"}]},{"heading":"UX & information architecture","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow2.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"A strong website makes complex things feel simple. We organise the content, structure the journeys and map the key interactions so people can find what they need without fighting the interface. Wireframes give us space to create all the structural foundations before visual design takes over.","duration":"1 week","weekNumber":3,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Sitemap development"},{"item":"Information architecture"},{"item":"Audience journey mapping"},{"item":"Content planning"},{"item":"Figma wireframes & prototyping"},{"item":"Functional specifications"}]},{"heading":"Creative direction","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow3.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"Now we decide how the website should feel. We explore visual territories, interaction ideas and digital behaviours that bring the brand to life online. This establishes the creative rules for the experience before they’re applied across the wider site.\r\n","duration":"1 week","weekNumber":4,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Creative exploration"},{"item":"Digital art direction"},{"item":"Typography & colour"},{"item":"Motion principles"},{"item":"Interaction concepts"},{"item":"Creative presentation"}]},{"heading":"UI & web design","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow4.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"With the direction agreed, we build the full visual system. Every page is designed to feel connected, responsive and recognisably yours. We consider hierarchy, accessibility, interaction and conversion alongside the creative details that give the site its character. We’ll design either bespoke templates for each page of the website (in mobile and desktop resolutions), or look to design a component builder approach.","duration":"2 weeks","weekNumber":5,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Responsive page design"},{"item":"UI components"},{"item":"Interaction design"},{"item":"Conversion touchpoints"},{"item":"Developer-ready files"}]},{"heading":"Web development","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow5.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"Our developers bring the design to life without sanding off its edges. We build responsive, high-performance websites with flexible CMS systems and carefully crafted front-end interactions. Development happens alongside design rather than appearing at the end to tell us what isn’t possible.","duration":"5 to 6 weeks","weekNumber":7,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Front-end development "},{"item":"Back-end development "},{"item":"CMS configuration"},{"item":"Component development"},{"item":"Motion design and interaction"},{"item":"Third-party integrations"},{"item":"Performance optimisation"}]},{"heading":"Content population & testing","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow5.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"Before launch, we put the whole thing through its paces. We populate agreed content, test the experience across browsers and devices and check performance, accessibility, forms, integrations and CMS functionality. Small details get the same attention as the headline moments.","duration":"1 to 2 weeks","weekNumber":10,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Content population"},{"item":"Responsive testing"},{"item":"Browser testing"},{"item":"Accessibility checks"},{"item":"Performance testing"},{"item":"CMS training"},{"item":"Quality assurance"}]},{"heading":"Launch & ongoing support","image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/workflow5.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":426,"height":426}},"text":"Going live isn’t where we disappear. We handle deployment carefully, monitor the site after launch and give your team the tools and training to manage it confidently. We can also stay involved through hosting, optimisation, SEO, content and ongoing creative support through our SiteCare packages.","duration":"Ongoing","weekNumber":12,"workInvolved":[{"item":"Launch planning"},{"item":"Website deployment"},{"item":"Redirect implementation"},{"item":"Technical SEO & GEO"},{"item":"Analytics setup"},{"item":"Post-launch testing"},{"item":"CMS documentation"},{"item":"Ongoing support packages"}]}]}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonials__J0bdm","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"Testimonials_heading__q4vc3","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"What our clients say."}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialDesktop__XClcG","children":["$","$L25",null,{"testimonials":[{"text":"\"As a design agency, handing responsibility for our web re-design to another creative agency needed to be well considered. We were immediately impressed by their designs and their interpretation of our brief. Nice bunch of people to work with too!\"","backgroundColor":"#a8e1ec","name":"Laurie Bushe","speciality":"Head of Marketing","button":{"title":"View project","url":"/work/tangerine/","target":""},"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/tangerine-logo.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":233,"height":53}}},{"text":"\"It was our brand positioning work that really made everything click. KOTA were empathetic, patient, flexible, quick, and, most importantly, incredibly talented with brand positioning, visual identity, and digital experiences. I've already recommended them twice!\"","backgroundColor":"#c4b5f3","name":"Shanice Daeche","speciality":"CMO","button":{"title":"View project","url":"/work/florence/","target":""},"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/05/Florence-Logo-White.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":230,"height":68}}},{"text":"\"Beyond the aesthetics, the site is incredibly functional. The CMS gives us the flexibility and control we need to keep our content fresh and relevant, and they have significantly improved the website’s UX. We couldn't be happier!\"","backgroundColor":"#efb2d9","name":"Jenny Frame","speciality":"Marketing Manager","button":{"title":"View project","url":"/work/incentive-games/","target":""},"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/incentive-games.png 640w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/incentive-games-500x303.png 500w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/incentive-games.png","mediaDetails":{"width":640,"height":388}}}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialMobile__B0_Aa","children":["$","$L25",null,{"testimonials":"$26"}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_relatedPosts__xfLkb","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_headingOuter__r3TEg","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_heading__3kOeH","children":["$","$L33",null,{"children":"Related Articles"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_viewAllLinkDesktop__db363","children":["$","$L33",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":["$","$L11",null,{"type":"a-internal","text":"View all articles","color":"white","href":"/blog"}]}]}]]}]}],["$","$L34",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","$L14","5850",{"className":"BlogPostCard_post__fNGbL BlogPostCard_small__j18h2","href":"/blog/10-creative-websites-to-inspire-your-next-web-design-2025-update","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"BlogPostCard_postImage__Q4k_I","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"BlogPostCard_tags__RKboe","children":[false,[["$","span","Inspiration",{"className":"BlogPostCard_tag__Dv5HS","children":"Inspiration"}]]]}],["$","$L35",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025.png 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025-500x281.png 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025-768x432.png 768w","sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/01/creative-web-design-inspo-2025.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1400,"height":787}},"layout":"fill"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"BlogPo